<Description language="ENGLISH">"Ablaze"</Description>
<Explanation language="ENGLISH">"On critical, add ablaze.
The condition is normally only applied if target is flammable but this weapon can set someone alight even is it is not normally combustible."</Explanation>
<Short language="ENGLISH">"Add Ablaze status on critical"</Short>
<Modifier>"+"</Modifier>
</BonusMalus>
<BonusMalus id="ARCH1-WEAPB36">
<Description language="ENGLISH">"Fertile earth"</Description>
<Explanation language="ENGLISH">"So long as it is allowed to rest in fertile earth each night, a Blackbriar Javelin inflicts 1 Poisoned condition on any target which looses at least 1 Wound from the attack.
This may be resisted with a Challenging (+0) Endurance Test."</Explanation>
<Short language="ENGLISH">"add Poisoned condition"</Short>
<Modifier>"+"</Modifier>
</BonusMalus>
